Package: lightr
Version: {{VERSION}}
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Nigel <nigel@example.com>
Depends: libc6
Description: Lightweight email server written in Go
 Lightr is a modern, lightweight email server that supports SMTP,
 IMAP, and provides a REST API for email management.
 .
 Features:
  - SMTP receiving and sending
  - IMAP access
  - REST API
  - Webhooks
  - Full-text search
  - SQLite storage
Homepage: https://github.com/nigelbasa/lightr
